      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wenden%2C_Arizona",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Route 60 cuts through Wenden, connecting it to Wickenburg 48 miles northeast and I‑10 30 miles southwest.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
